AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0002514> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/uberon/core#mouse_subset>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0002514> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/uberon.owl>)
